1-VAE_module_14B_bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/vae`\n\n\n---\n### 🟣 WAN Text Encoder\n`umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`\n\n---\n### ⚠️ Torch Compile Warning  \nIf your setup doesn’t support torch compile, set attention mode to `sdpa` in the model loader and bypas the Torch Compile settings and adjust the base_precision to just fp16\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Block Swapping\nBlock swapping helps if you have lower VRAM and/or get OOM. You can bypass it first and then update the blocks to swap to a higher number till you don't get OOM (up to 40) It will run slower so don't use if you have enough VRAM.\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Errors\nIf you get an error about 'fp16_accumulation'\nthis just means you need to update your base_precision in the model loader to fp16 from fp16_fast.\n\n---\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "WAN - START HERE", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [445.40093994140625, 916.0010986328125], "pos": [-642.9859619140625, -81.42681884765625], "id": 288, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [123, 133], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [315, 314], "pos": [317.6001892089844, -48.40477752685547], "widgets_values": ["e856dd964e7a63576e4ae1741076ed85345bfc3fac2ea99cdcd5b2a1dea247de.png", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.29", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "model", "slot_index": 0, "links": [29], "label": "model"